@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam svgLinkTarget _top
top to bottom direction
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F4F7FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #57718A
title No global free order
state "leader" as actor0 {
state "free leader\n调用进入\ninclude/a.hpp:4" as a0 <<enter>> [[../index.html?protocol=protocol&event=l_free]]
state "free leader\n调用返回\ninclude/a.hpp:4" as a1 <<return>> [[../index.html?protocol=protocol&event=l_free]]
}
state "peer" as actor1 {
state "free peer\n调用进入\ninclude/a.hpp:4" as a2 <<enter>> [[../index.html?protocol=protocol&event=p_free]]
state "free peer\n调用返回\ninclude/a.hpp:4" as a3 <<return>> [[../index.html?protocol=protocol&event=p_free]]
}
a0 --> a1 : l_free.intra\nsame invocation
a2 --> a3 : p_free.intra\nsame invocation
legend bottom
箭头只表示记录的偏序约束；图中高度和数组顺序均不构成额外先后关系。
enter / return / effect分别指调用进入、返回和明确定义的效果；不将返回等同异步完成。
端点链接保留每个API事件、参与范围、源码和条件。不同CTA事件不合并。
endlegend
@enduml
